"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[7065],{87065:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n# SELinux mode\\nSELinux (Security Enhanced Linux)의 Mode를 설정할 수 있습니다.\\n\\n## SELinux Mode\\n- Enforce (default): Any action that violates the policy is blocked and logged.\\n- Permissive: Actions that violate the policy are allowed but are logged. This mode is used for debugging.\\n- Disabled\\n\\n## Change Mode with Utils\\n- setenforce를 통해 mode 변경이 가능합니다.\\n- Kernel에서 sysfs에 write 권한이 있기 때문에 직접 접근도 가능합니다.\\n```sh\\n{\\n\\t\\"title\\": \\"use util\\"\\n}\\n---\\n$ getenforce \\nPermissive  \\n  \\n$ setenforce 1 // Enforcing 모드로 변환\\n  \\n$ getenforce \\nEnforcing\\n```\\n```sh\\n{\\n\\t\\"title\\": \\"sysfs access directly\\"\\n}\\n---\\n$ cat /sys/fs/selinux/enforce\\n1\\n  \\n$ echo 0 > /sys/fs/selinux/enforce // Permissive 모드로 변환\\n  \\n$ getenforce \\nPermissive\\n```\\n## Change Mode Code Flow\\n- setenforce util 에서는 ```security_setenforce()``` 함수를 이용하여 Control 합니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n  \\"title\\": \\"selinux/libselinux/utils/setenforce.c\\",\\n  \\"ln\\": false\\n}\\n---\\nint main(int argc, char **argv)\\n{\\n...\\n        if (strlen(argv[1]) == 1 && (argv[1][0] == \'0\' || argv[1][0] == \'1\')) {\\n                rc = security_setenforce(atoi(argv[1]));  // [!code highlight]\\n        } else {\\n                if (strcasecmp(argv[1], \\"enforcing\\") == 0) {\\n                        rc = security_setenforce(1);  // [!code highlight]\\n                } else if (strcasecmp(argv[1], \\"permissive\\") == 0) {\\n                        rc = security_setenforce(0);  // [!code highlight]\\n                } else\\n                        usage(argv[0]);\\n        }\\n...\\n}\\n```\\n- libselinux의 security_setenforce()에서 ```selinux mount point (/sys/fs/selinux)```에 접근하여 write를 합니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n\\t\\"title\\": \\"selinux/libselinux/src/setenforce.c\\"\\n}\\n---\\nint security_setenforce(int value)\\n{\\n...\\n\\tsnprintf(path, sizeof path, \\"%s/enforce\\", selinux_mnt);\\n\\tfd = open(path, O_RDWR | O_CLOEXEC); // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (fd < 0)\\n\\t\\treturn -1;\\n\\n\\tsnprintf(buf, sizeof buf, \\"%d\\", value);\\n\\tret = write(fd, buf, strlen(buf)); // [!code highlight]\\n...\\n}\\n```\\n- <mark>selinux_mnt</mark>는 library constructor에 의해 수행되는 ```init_selinuxmnt```에서 설정됩니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n\\t\\"title\\": \\"selinux/libselinux/src/init.c\\"\\n}\\n---\\nstatic void init_lib(void) __attribute__ ((constructor));\\nstatic void init_lib(void)\\n{\\n...\\n\\tinit_selinuxmnt(); // [!code highlight]\\n#ifndef ANDROID\\n\\thas_selinux_config = (access(SELINUXCONFIG, F_OK) == 0);\\n#endif\\n}\\n-> \\nstatic void init_selinuxmnt(void)\\n{\\n...\\n\\tif (verify_selinuxmnt(SELINUXMNT) == 0) return; // [!code highlight]\\n}\\n->\\nstatic int verify_selinuxmnt(const char *mnt)\\n{\\n...\\n\\tset_selinuxmnt(mnt);  // [!code highlight]\\n}\\n->\\nvoid set_selinuxmnt(const char *mnt)\\n{\\n\\tselinux_mnt = strdup(mnt);\\n}\\n```\\n- <mark>SELINUXMNT</mark> 역시 코드에 정의되어 있습니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n\\t\\"title\\": \\"selinux/libselinux/src/policy.h\\"\\n}\\n---\\n#define SELINUXMNT \\"/sys/fs/selinux\\"\\n```\\n- Kernel에서는 이미 sysfs에 mount point를 만들어 놓았습니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"linux/security/selinux/selinuxfs.c\\"\\n}\\n---\\nstatic int __init init_sel_fs(void)\\n{\\n...\\n\\terr = sysfs_create_mount_point(fs_kobj, \\"selinux\\"); // [!code highlight]\\n```\\n- 물론 selinuxfs로 mount를 해야 합니다.\\n- 대부분 systemd 또느 init.rc에서 mount 하도록 설정되어 있을겁니다.\\n```bash\\n$ mount | grep selinux\\n\\nselinuxfs on /sys/fs/selinux type selinuxfs (rw,realtime)\\n```\\n- 참고로 kernel config에서 <mark>CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_DEVELOP</mark>이 disable 이면 sysfs를 통한 mode 변경이 불가능 합니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"linux/security/selinux/selinuxfs.c\\"\\n}\\n---\\n#ifdef CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_DEVELOP\\nstatic ssize_t sel_write_enforce(struct file *file, const char __user *buf,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t size_t count, loff_t *ppos)\\n{\\n...\\n#else\\n#define sel_write_enforce NULL\\n#endif\\n\\nstatic const struct file_operations sel_enforce_ops = {\\n\\t.read\\t\\t= sel_read_enforce,\\n\\t.write\\t\\t= sel_write_enforce,\\n\\t.llseek\\t\\t= generic_file_llseek,\\n};\\n```"}')}}]);